# Coefficient and observation tables shipped as resources are byte-for-byte copies of
# what was retrieved. The root .gitattributes normalises line endings across the repo;
# these files are exempted for the same reason vendor/** is: their bytes are pinned by
# SHA-256 in tests, and a checkout-time EOL rewrite would make those tests pass on Linux
# and fail on Windows.
src/main/resources/org/panchang/ephemeris/VSOP87D.ear    -text
src/main/resources/org/panchang/ephemeris/deltat-iers.csv -text
src/test/resources/org/panchang/ephemeris/vsop87d-earth-checkvalues.txt -text
